    "type": "text",
    "text": "Ran the self-healing loop on an input the system could not answer directly: reasoned about the failure trace, mapped it onto src/agentic_coding/planner.rs with a verified source-to-links round-trip, learned a benchmark-gated lesson, and recorded an auditable repair case (awaiting_review). Nothing was applied — adoption stays a human-approved review step.\n\nGenerated document (self-healing-case.lino):\n\nrepair_case\n  id \"repair_case_9de88924139c1553\"\n  failure_prompt \"List the files but sort the results in reverse order\"\n  outcome \"awaiting_review\"\n  human_gated \"true\"\n  source_round_trip\n    module_path \"src/agentic_coding/planner.rs\"\n    total_link_count \"13100\"\n    named_node_count \"2597\"\n    faithful \"true\"\n  failure_trace\n    unknown_trace\n      id \"unknown_trace_0b5bfd2b6b7cdae9\"\n      prompt \"List the files but sort the results in reverse order\"\n      event_count \"3\"\n      event\n        kind \"selected_rule\"\n        id \"selected_rule_c4b73715d69a320a\"\n        payload \"initial unknown reason no_seed_route next try_rule_synthesis\"\n      event\n        kind \"rule_synthesis_candidate\"\n        id \"rule_synthesis_candidate_a72cf4a7d25ca712\"\n        payload \"rule_synthesis_candidate\\n  id reverse_sort_list_files\\n  source constructed_from_operation_vocabulary\\n  base_task list_files\\n  modifier reverse_sort\\n  operation sort\\n  operation_modifier descending\\n  target program:last.output_order\\n  resolved_task list_files_reverse_sort\"\n      event\n        kind \"rule_verification\"\n        id \"rule_verification_5225998dff6d7324\"\n        payload \"rule_verification\\n  candidate reverse_sort_list_files\\n  fixture list_files_output_order\\n  input a.txt,b.txt,c.txt\\n  expected_order c.txt,b.txt,a.txt\\n  lowering_check passed\\n  render_check passed\\n  status passed\"\n  learning_run\n    self_improvement_run\n      id \"self_improvement_run_10f7d0dab049048f\"\n      trace_count \"1\"\n      benchmark_suite \"issue_362_multilingual_coding_modification\"\n      benchmark_runner \"cargo test --test unit issue_362_multilingual_multi_turn_coding_modification_ratchet -- --nocapture\"\n      benchmark_passed \"4\"\n      benchmark_failed \"0\"\n      benchmark_minimum_pass_count \"4\"\n      benchmark_status \"passed\"\n      learned_rule\n        id \"learned_rule_1979c4a27fe2ea09\"\n        trace \"unknown_trace_0b5bfd2b6b7cdae9\"\n        rule \"reverse_sort_list_files\"\n        base_task \"list_files\"\n        modifier \"reverse_sort\"\n        resolved_task \"list_files_reverse_sort\"\n        fixture \"list_files_output_order\"\n        adoption \"adoptable\"\n        summary \"Learn `reverse_sort` for `list_files` by rewriting to `list_files_reverse_sort`; fixture `list_files_output_order` passed; benchmark `issue_362_multilingual_coding_modification` is passed (4/4).\"\n        seed_rule \"substitution_rules\\n  id 'learned_program_plan_rules'\\n  rule 'reverse_sort_list_files'\\n    order '90'\\n    event 'learned'\\n    when 'request:modifier -> reverse_sort'\\n    replace 'request:task -> list_files'\\n      with 'request:task -> list_files_reverse_sort'\"",
